# Reviewers requested by GitHub on every pull request.
# Copy this file to .github/CODEOWNERS of the product repository and put
# the GitHub user names of your reviewers in place of the placeholders.
# GitHub never asks the author of the pull request, so with two names each
# developer gets the other one. One line per person to change it.
# The ruleset of github-protect-master.sh does not require a code owner
# approval (require_code_owner_review is false): any colleague with write
# access may approve. Set it to true to make the owners mandatory.
*  @owner-one  @owner-two
